sqlparse-rs ports the lexer and the StatementSplitter of python-sqlparse 0.6.1
(https://github.com/andialbrecht/sqlparse, BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2009-2020 the sqlparse authors
and contributors) to Rust.

src/gen.rs is generated by gen/gen_tables.py from sqlparse itself: the regular expressions of
sqlparse.keywords.SQL_REGEX (parsed with CPython's own re parser), the keyword dictionaries and the
token types. Character classes are computed by running CPython's re engine over every code point.

tests/upstream/ is sqlparse's own test suite (BSD-3-Clause), unchanged.
